{"_meta":{"source":"Yahoo Finance via yfinance (profile, statements, analyst estimates)","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T16:51:08+00:00","status":"ok","error":null,"last_success":"2026-10-28T16:51:08+00:00"},"data":{"profile":{"name":"SAF-Holland SE","sector":"Consumer Cyclical","industry":"Auto Parts","country":"Germany","city":"Bessenbach","website":"https://www.safholland.com","employees":5579,"summary":"SAF-Holland SE manufactures and sells chassis-related assemblies and components for trailers, trucks, semi-trailers, and buses. The company offers axle and air suspension systems, fifth wheels and systems, coupling systems, kingpins, and landing gears, as well as braking and EBS systems, lighting systems, and disc brakes. It markets its products under the SAF, Holland, Haldex, Neway, KLL, V.Orlandi, TrailerMaster, Assali Stefen, Tecma, and York brands. The company serves original equipment manufacturers. It primarily operates in Europe, the Middle East, Africa, the Americas, and the Asia Pacific. SAF-Holland SE was founded in 1881 and is headquartered in Bessenbach, Germany.","exchange":"XETRA","currency":"EUR","financial_currency":"EUR","summary_fr":"SAF-Holland SE fabrique et vend des assemblages et des composants liés aux châssis pour remorques, camions, semi-remorques et autobus. La société propose des systèmes de suspension par essieu et pneumatique, des cinquièmes roues et systèmes, des systèmes d'accouplement, des pivots et des trains d'atterrissage, ainsi que des systèmes de freinage et d'EBS, des systèmes d'éclairage et des freins à disque. Elle commercialise ses produits sous les marques SAF, Holland, Haldex, Neway, KLL, V.Orlandi, TrailerMaster, Assali Stefen, Tecma et York."},"valuation":{"market_cap_yahoo":957819840,"shares_outstanding":45394302,"trailing_pe":13.881579,"forward_pe":9.150996,"price_to_book":1.8695729,"ev_to_ebitda":7.012,"ev_to_revenue":0.827,"dividend_yield":0.0309,"payout_ratio":0.4276,"beta_yahoo":1.672},"targets":{"current_price":21.1,"m